{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:44:08+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Light Brigade: Definitive Edition", "steam_appid": 1579880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Frame Verified</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/dcb98a65b55282ed560d561933ace43a.webp?t=1787332700\" width=378 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Light Brigade is fully <strong><u>Steam Frame Verified</u></strong>, running silky smooth at full native resolution and delivering a seamless standalone VR experience right out of the box.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/0f81c2454b3b9fced88f6481ad8ef452.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/0f81c2454b3b9fced88f6481ad8ef452.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/0f81c2454b3b9fced88f6481ad8ef452.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist in the ranks of <i>The Light Brigade</i>, humanity’s last line of defense, and journey through procedurally-generated battlegrounds as many times as it takes to free the souls of the fallen trapped within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/d5527403e6805e0fd7fd82e4ca2a8673.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/305c2715fc7e8bda36b327353b110ff3.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic gunplay inspired by historical World War weaponry creates tense battles against increasingly difficult enemy soldiers, creatures, and bosses. In VR, aiming, shooting, and reloading bolt-action rifles, machine guns and pistols feels highly immersive and tactile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/c9532eb339c72df04456f3ad2d239d93.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/c9532eb339c72df04456f3ad2d239d93.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/c9532eb339c72df04456f3ad2d239d93.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/b5ffc878257d5f8be2d38a0d80df3be5.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful light magic pairs beautifully with gunplay. From infusing your rifle's bullets with light magic to raining fireballs on enemy hordes, magic spells complement your rifle by adding more combat tools to your arsenal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/9f093e6d612f03b9904a7e43746b48c0.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/a8ec97747226e4e2dd1a4ce649828bc7.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your run with a standard-issue rifle and loot for powerful attachments like explosive charms, poison gun barrels, tactical scopes, silencers, and more. If you fall to enemy fire, survive long enough to retrieve your fallen soul or lose your run progress to permadeath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1025ec4f6b779d6d527152291ac6cbb3.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1025ec4f6b779d6d527152291ac6cbb3.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1025ec4f6b779d6d527152291ac6cbb3.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/fddf5ef2f5c8b1f9a25f6c42a44d4f11.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleanse the souls of the fallen to climb the ranks of The Light Brigade and spend rank points to upgrade your weapon, passive abilities, and spells. Unlock new player classes and gain access to new weapons, loadouts and play styles, adding even more variety to your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/5dad6cf485f7e6a3d07d0e8e582854b3.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot treasure chests and enemies during your run to collect an array of magical tarot cards, each with unique powers, buff/debuffs and passive abilities. Acquire stronger versions of these cards to create devastating stacking effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/5c5a7f135ca54ac0ac3c811933f67b11.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/58009c490ae5633ea1df320e1ac2e2b7.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/58009c490ae5633ea1df320e1ac2e2b7.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/58009c490ae5633ea1df320e1ac2e2b7.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/72a5adf32410d6454932b7bcdbb7fae8.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinitely procedurally-generated battlegrounds make each run completely unique, forcing you to traverse carefully through ever-changing hostile environments. Enemy soldiers lurk around every corner, so position and strategy is crucial for survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1ca9c907a8f180e64e63fcc0c7c954ca.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1ca9c907a8f180e64e63fcc0c7c954ca.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1ca9c907a8f180e64e63fcc0c7c954ca.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/6cc77237006c36ae5367395c346fe981.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What led to the world's downfall? What do the Obsidian Forces want? Uncover these mysteries and bring the world back from the brink of total darkness before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/d053cd270b8166cd75a346a255ae6068.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=939 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With this final &quot;Definitive Edition&quot; update, we want to express our heartfelt thanks to everyone who has played and supported The Light Brigade.</strong><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game’s initial release in Feb 2023, we’ve spent the next three and a half years supporting and expanding the experience through <strong>5 Major Content Updates</strong> and countless minor updates. Your feedback helped us add new worlds, weapons, abilities, classes, enemies, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been an honor building this game alongside such an incredible community. Thank you for joining us on this journey and for helping make The Light Brigade what it is today. If you’d like to stay connected with us and the community, please join our Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/63dbe0c265ea13d5a1cd45096f93e9c7.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/63dbe0c265ea13d5a1cd45096f93e9c7.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/63dbe0c265ea13d5a1cd45096f93e9c7.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/0f81c2454b3b9fced88f6481ad8ef452.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/0f81c2454b3b9fced88f6481ad8ef452.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/0f81c2454b3b9fced88f6481ad8ef452.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist in the ranks of <i>The Light Brigade</i>, humanity’s last line of defense, and journey through procedurally-generated battlegrounds as many times as it takes to free the souls of the fallen trapped within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/d5527403e6805e0fd7fd82e4ca2a8673.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class