.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1ca9c907a8f180e64e63fcc0c7c954ca.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1ca9c907a8f180e64e63fcc0c7c954ca.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/1ca9c907a8f180e64e63fcc0c7c954ca.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/6cc77237006c36ae5367395c346fe981.webp?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=19 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What led to the world's downfall? What do the Obsidian Forces want? Uncover these mysteries and bring the world back from the brink of total darkness before it's too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/d053cd270b8166cd75a346a255ae6068.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=939 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With this final &quot;Definitive Edition&quot; update, we want to express our heartfelt thanks to everyone who has played and supported The Light Brigade.</strong><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game’s initial release in Feb 2023, we’ve spent the next three and a half years supporting and expanding the experience through <strong>5 Major Content Updates</strong> and countless minor updates. Your feedback helped us add new worlds, weapons, abilities, classes, enemies, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been an honor building this game alongside such an incredible community. Thank you for joining us on this journey and for helping make The Light Brigade what it is today. If you’d like to stay connected with us and the community, please join our Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/63dbe0c265ea13d5a1cd45096f93e9c7.poster.avif?t=1787332700\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/63dbe0c265ea13d5a1cd45096f93e9c7.webm?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/extras/63dbe0c265ea13d5a1cd45096f93e9c7.mp4?t=1787332700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "An award-winning roguelike VR shooter with realistic gunplay &amp; immersive light magic. Ascend the ranks of The Light Brigade to unlock new weapons, upgrades, classes, and abilities as you fight to restore light to the darkness.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“It’s just pure action-adventure fun”<br>8.5/10 – Road to VR<br><br>“Easily one of the best games I've played”<br>9/10 – 6DOFReviews<br><br>“The Best NEW VR Roguelike... Prepare to be ADDICTED”<br>Beardo Banjo<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/b702306b3c147b041197d838f0ef2e75449eec86/header.jpg?t=1787332700", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/45ed23bf5d70c9a021b48769a8534767c6aa909a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787332700", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579880/45ed23bf5d70c9a021b48769a8534767c6aa909a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787332700", "website": "https://www.lightbrigadevr.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor